  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BEOG NEERE is a nonprofit association under Burkinab&#xE8; law. Founded in 2012 by young people and led by young people, BEOG NEERE works throughout Burkina Faso and Francophone Africa to promote the rule of law, democracy, and good governance. BEOG NEERE&#x2019;s overall mission is to promote advocacy services to improve people&apos;s quality of life, social stability, and economic well-being. (Strategy: Inclusive Governance)</narrative>
